 {r}←{x}Add fileList;path;rc;msg;buff;space
⍝ Stage files defined by `fileList` which defaults to "." (all unstaged files).\\
⍝ Alternatively you may specify a specific file (string) or a list of files (vector of strings).
⍝ It can also be a wildcard expression that catches a number of files like *.txt or invoice_??.txt.\\
⍝ `x` must be one of:
⍝   * Fully qualified name of a namespace that is an opened Cider project
⍝   * Fully qualified path to a Git-managed project\\
⍝ Returns a 0.\\
⍝ Examples:
⍝ Add ''  ⍝ With Cider
⍝ #.MyProject Add ''
⍝ '/path/2/project'Add'.'
⍝ #.MyProject Add'APLSource/Hello.aplf'
⍝ #.MyProject Add'APLSource/*.aplf'
⍝ #.MyProject Add'APLSource/Hello.aplf' 'APLSource/Pi.aplf'
 r←0
 x←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ ''}'x'
 (space path)←EstablishProject x
 :If 0=≢fileList
     fileList←'.'
 :Else
     fileList←⊆fileList
 :EndIf
 :If (,'.')≡,fileList
     (rc msg buff)←path U.RunGitCommand'add ',fileList
 :Else
     fileList←⊃,/' ',¨{' '∊⍵:'"',⍵,'"' ⋄ ⍵}¨fileList
     (rc msg buff)←path U.RunGitCommand'add ',fileList
 :EndIf
 msg U.Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
